%% aoneahsan-cccs-verification — full flow
flowchart TD
    trigger([About to claim done / fixed / works / ready]) --> ran{Ran the proving command<br/>THIS turn?}
    ran -->|no| identify[Identify the command<br/>that proves the claim]
    identify --> run[Run it fresh + in full<br/>one-shot gates, never a watch server]
    run --> read[Read full output:<br/>exit code + failure count]
    read --> confirm{Output actually<br/>confirms the claim?}
    ran -->|yes, output in hand| confirm

    confirm -->|no| honest[State ACTUAL status with evidence;<br/>fix, then re-verify]
    honest --> trigger
    confirm -->|yes| reqs{Task-level claim?<br/>re-read original request}
    reqs -->|requirements gap| honest
    reqs -->|line-by-line checklist all met| runnable{Change can be<br/>exercised for real?}

    runnable -->|yes| exercise[run-to-verify: background server<br/>+ headless browser, then kill it]
    runnable -->|no| claim
    exercise --> claim[Claim WITH evidence:<br/>Completed / Remaining / Not-done / Verification]
    claim --> done([Honest completion])

    run -.gates + grant.-> reg[(../rules/dev-workflow.md)]

    classDef gate fill:#fff4e6,stroke:#d97706,color:#7c2d12
    classDef terminal fill:#ecfdf5,stroke:#059669,color:#064e3b
    classDef warn fill:#fef2f2,stroke:#dc2626,color:#7f1d1d
    class ran,confirm,reqs,runnable gate
    class trigger,done terminal
    class honest warn
